 341:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *
 342:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** * Summary:
 343:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *  Clears flags that control the operating mode of the clock. This function
 344:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *  only changes flags from 1 to 0; flags that are already 0 will remain
 345:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *  unchanged. To set flags, use the SetModeRegister function. The clock must be
 346:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *  disabled before changing the mode.
 347:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *
 348:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** * Parameters:
 349:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *  clkMode: Bit mask containing the bits to clear. For PSoC 3 and PSoC 5,
 350:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *   clkMode should be a set of the following optional bits or'ed together.
 351:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *   - CYCLK_EARLY Enable early phase mode. Rising edge of output clock will
 352:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *                 occur when the divider count reaches half of the divide
 353:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *                 value.
 354:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *   - CYCLK_DUTY  Enable 50% duty cycle output. When enabled, the output clock
 355:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *                 is asserted for approximately half of its period. When
 356:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *                 disabled, the output clock is asserted for one period of the
 357:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *                 source clock.
 358:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *   - CYCLK_SYNC  Enable output synchronization to master clock. This should
 359:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *                 be enabled for all synchronous clocks.
 360:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *   See the Technical Reference Manual for details about setting the mode of
 361:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *   the clock. Specifically, see the CLKDIST.DCFG.CFG2 register.
 362:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *
 363:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** * Returns:
 364:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *  None
 365:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *
 366:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_3.c **** *******************************************************************************/
